<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The app itself — one url, and that is not an oversight.

  The reader addresses chapters with a HASH route
  (`#/2thessalonians/2:1?v=nasb`, see lib/services/url_sync_service_web.dart).
  Fragments are never sent to the server, and Google retired the
  AJAX-crawling scheme in 2015, so every hash route is the same document
  to a crawler. The app also accepts `?verse=` / `?sermon=` query links
  (main.dart `_handleDeepLink`) and those ARE distinct urls — but every
  one of them returns byte-identical HTML, so listing them would be
  submitting duplicates of this page.

  The actual crawlable pages live under `/read/` and `/sermons/` and are
  listed in the generated sitemaps that `sitemap.xml` indexes. This file
  covers the three entry points that belong to none of them: the
  application itself, the `/read/` hub, and the `/sermons/` hub.

  `/read/` is here because it fell in a gap — each generated sitemap
  starts at `/read/<edition>/`, and this one used to hold only `/`, so
  the one page linking all five editions together appeared in NO
  sitemap at all (found 2026-08-31 by counting: 4,344 edition urls + 1
  home against 4,346 generated pages). It was still reachable — every
  one of those 4,344 pages links to it from the footer — but the entry
  point to the whole tree should not depend on that.

  `/sermons/` reproduced that gap exactly, on the same day, for the same
  structural reason: the three generated sermon sitemaps each start at
  `/sermons/<language>/`, so the hub that chooses between the languages
  was in none of them (932 generated pages against 930 listed — the
  other one is the 404 body, which is deliberately unlisted). Adding a
  namespace here is not optional bookkeeping; it is the step that is
  easy to skip twice.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>https://yahwehword.com/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://yahwehword.com/read/</loc>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.9</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://yahwehword.com/sermons/</loc>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.9</priority>
  </url>
</urlset>
